ait to escape into this world\u2019s <strong><i>haunting lore</i></strong>, woven from Irish mythology, early Christian philosophy, and Japanese American history. By poring over ancient texts and researching on-location, Melos and Marina have grounded their world in truth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/3ba87e847b298c246e4dcad816c7a256.poster.avif?t=1751097653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/3ba87e847b298c246e4dcad816c7a256.webm?t=1751097653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/3ba87e847b298c246e4dcad816c7a256.mp4?t=1751097653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANGEL ARKAS:</strong> Truth is not limited to dusty details, Tets. You've forgotten about Angeline Era's tales of <strong><i>fruitless yearning, life-shattering betrayal </i></strong>and<i><strong> unsettling beauty</strong></i>! Only the truths of the heart will bring forth the future...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PRINCESS NIAMH:</strong> What on earth are you two going on about? This is an action game. <strong><i>KILL, KILL!!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/9f9f51036daaa7e97820f29367024095.poster.avif?t=1751097653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/9f9f51036daaa7e97820f29367024095.webm?t=1751097653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/9f9f51036daaa7e97820f29367024095.mp4?t=1751097653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of levels with bosses and a story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action levels AND exploration-and-lore focused levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix it up with subweapons and a gun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit towns to shop for items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a nonlinear world at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable, 8-12 hour single-player experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-difficulty setting for Beginner Bumpslashers, and nightmarish settings for the deranged</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Anodyne 2 and Sephonie's devs, Melos and Marina!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/800a4e1d996fd703c1551b074d2b5ca9.avif?t=1751097653\" /></span></p>",
